Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.94,STAFF,,0,0,391,,{\blur3}台本：微烁
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.94,STAFF,,0,0,478,,{\blur3}翻译：nagisa  芳草萋萋
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.94,STAFF,,0,0,565,,{\blur3}校对：小江
